    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start from scratch in a peaceful village.</strong><br>Grow your own food, sell your products, buy your car and become part of a close-knit community. Build friendships, fall in love with a village girl, and start a family. Live a simple, fulfilling life surrounded by nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Drive your car\u00a0</strong>freely through fields, forests, and village roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.poster.avif?t=1754665945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.webm?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.mp4?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3eDig the Soil then Start Planting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.poster.avif?t=1754665945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.webm?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.mp4?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Plant and grow</strong> crops across seasons \u2013 from seeding to harvest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.poster.avif?t=1754665945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.webm?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.mp4?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Coming\u00a0<strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Free Driving</strong> \u2013 Hop in your car and freely explore your surroundings: lush forests, quiet fields, and the village roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farming from Scratch</strong> \u2013 Start with just a few seeds and grow your farm into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Seasonal Crops</strong> \u2013 Plant and harvest different crops across all four seasons, each with its own visuals and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Land Preparation</strong> \u2013 Dig, water, and fertilize your soil to ensure maximum yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 <strong>Animal Care</strong> \u2013 Raise livestock like cows and chickens. Feed them daily, collect their products, and unlock new animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Home Customization</strong> \u2013 Decorate and expand your house with furniture, colors, and styles that suit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 <strong>Relationship &amp; Romance</strong> \u2013 Befriend villagers and build meaningful relationships. Some may even lead to romance and family life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Village Economy</strong> \u2013 Sell your harvest, animal goods, and fish at the local market to earn coins and grow your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc6 <strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Experience changing weather, a day-night cycle, and seasonal events that bring the village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Festivals &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Join in on special village festivals, competitions, and story events throughout the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Immersive World</strong> \u2013 Handcrafted details, atmospheric sound design, and cozy visuals bring your farming village to life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start from scratch in a peaceful village.</strong><br>Grow your own food, sell your products, buy your car and become part of a close-knit community. Build friendships, fall in love with a village girl, and start a family. Live a simple, fulfilling life surrounded by nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Drive your car\u00a0</strong>freely through fields, forests, and village roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.poster.avif?t=1754665945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.webm?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.mp4?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3eDig the Soil then Start Planting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.poster.avif?t=1754665945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.webm?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.mp4?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Plant and grow</strong> crops across seasons \u2013 from seeding to harvest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.poster.avif?t=1754665945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.webm?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.mp4?t=1754665945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Coming\u00a0<strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Free Driving</strong> \u2013 Hop in your car and freely explore your surroundings: lush forests, quiet fields, and the village roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farming from Scratch</strong> \u2013 Start with just a few seeds and grow your farm into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Seasonal Crops</strong> \u2013 Plant and harvest different crops across all four seasons, each with its own visuals and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Land Preparation</strong> \u2013 Dig, water, and fertilize your soil to ensure maximum yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 <strong>Animal Care</strong> \u2013 Raise livestock like cows and chickens. Feed them daily, collect their products, and unlock new animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Home Customization</strong> \u2013 Decorate and expand your house with furniture, colors, and styles that suit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 <strong>Relationship &amp; Romance</strong> \u2013 Befriend villagers and build meaningful relationships. Some may even lead to romance and family life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Village Economy</strong> \u2013 Sell your harvest, animal goods, and fish at the local market to earn coins and grow your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc6 <strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Experience changing weather, a day-night cycle, and seasonal events that bring the village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Festivals &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Join in on special village festivals, competitions, and story events throughout the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Immersive World</strong> \u2013 Handcrafted details, atmospheric sound design, and cozy visuals bring your farming village to life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
